Package: claudia-mcp-server
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Claudia Platform <platform@sicoru.org>
Depends: systemd
Installed-Size: 108928
Description: Claudia MCP server -- shared core for project-specific MCP tool servers
 A config-driven Model Context Protocol server, extracted from the real,
 duplicated petgi-mcp/lintel-mcp Supabase Edge Functions. Handles JSON-RPC
 protocol, bearer-token authorization against claudia-mcp-oauth, and a
 declarative RPC-backed tool dispatch loop. Project-specific tools are
 supplied via a JSON file referenced from /etc/claudia-mcp/config.json --
 no code changes needed to point this at a new project.
 .
 Compiled as a single, dependency-free binary (deno compile) -- no
 separate runtime needs to be installed on the target machine.
